{
  "reportDate": "2026-11-13",
  "scope": "Certified closed-entry dependencies, reviewed-source edits, shared evidence, media metadata/pins and indexed tag browsing",
  "methodology": [
    "Release arm64. Synthetic fixtures and private hosts only; no clicks, installed Dev application/data access, real account or endpoint.",
    "Before packages are archived from c2cf05a1. The same Swift fixture compiles against both revisions. Each size starts from one closed seed; its SQLite SHA256 is verified before variant preparation.",
    "Each variant installs metadata and completes strict validation outside operation timers, closes, then supplies a fresh connection and independent closed copy for every command/trial. Canonical workload is shared; derived schema/certificate bytes differ after per-variant preparation.",
    "Each entry has two senses and four examples; semantic node/mapping count is 1.4 times entry count. Every fifth entry has an enrolled sense; 1000 rating events are retained. One reviewed source has eight additional templates.",
    "There are 512 distinct referenced 2x1 synthetic PNGs plus one prepared owned image outside the document. This stresses registry/pin density, not large-PNG preparation/IO. Prepared-image attachment excludes staging; supplied PNG staging has focused correctness coverage.",
    "Engine command timers exclude draft/detail construction, fixture copies and assertions. They include certificate admission and the normal full fallback when required. Reviewed cases verify FSRS/schedule retention and every mutation verifies all 1000 historical events.",
    "Each operation has three alternating before/after observations per size: 120 engine samples. Medians/minima/maxima are descriptive observations, not percentiles. OS disk caches are not purged.",
    "Example movement was removed from the optimization scope pending business modeling; the existing dedicated command/entry point was not changed.",
    "Native store readiness and engine commands are separate milestones on different generated fixtures. Their absolute timings cannot be added or substituted. The complete earlier 43-operation inventory was not rerun.",
    "Missing/stale proof and explicit complete consumers still perform strict full preparation. Dense-alias and large-media byte throughput are not measured by these fixtures.",
    "Paired samples describe the measured optimization tree before the subsequent empty-sense/manual-context-control business simplification; they are not timings of those later business changes."
  ],
